  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Equality &amp; Rights, Bolstering Inclusive Action</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme aims to address the absence of fully inclusive policies and systems that cater to the rights and needs of persons with disabilities. That hinders the effective realization of disability rights but also compromises Serbia&#x2019;s compliance with the Convention on the Rights of Persons with Disabilities (CRPD) and Sustainable Development Goals (SDGs). To rectify this, programme adopts a three-pronged approach.</narrative>
  </description>
